            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0 Mini films **Opening** with the host from **Keep**, four seconds at `720p` in a `9:16` frame. With an Element connected, the node uses `m2v`, the mode that takes references, and `{{reference1}}` in the prompt marks the host.\n\nA cancel does not stop a video Dreamina has accepted. It keeps running and is billed. Collect it with **Generation: Download** in **video-04-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
