      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0 Mini films **Closing** with the same Element, so the host matches **Shot 1**. Each shot is its own run and is billed.\n\nA cancel does not stop a video Dreamina has accepted. It keeps running and is billed. Collect it with **Generation: Download** in **video-04-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
